      <div class="olr-faq-groups">
        <section class="olr-faq-group is-open" id="faq-products" data-faq-category="products">
          <button class="olr-faq-group__heading" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-products-questions">
            <span class="olr-faq-group__number">01</span><span>Products + quality</span><span class="olr-faq-group__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="olr-faq-group__questions" id="faq-products-questions">
            <details><summary>What is Off Label Research?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Off Label Research supplies independently tested compounds for qualified laboratory research. Every product is labeled for research use only.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Are your products third-party tested?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Yes. Available batches are independently tested and matched to documentation by product and lot number.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>What is a Certificate of Analysis (COA)?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>A Certificate of Analysis is a laboratory record that reports the identity, purity, and other available analytical findings for a tested batch.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Where can I find your COAs?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Visit the testing and document archive, then match the product name and lot number on your label to the corresponding record.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>What does 99%+ purity mean?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>It means the reported analytical purity for the tested sample was greater than 99 percent. Review the associated record for the exact result and method.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Do you manufacture your products?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>We work with specialized suppliers and independent laboratories. Our focus is sourcing, documentation, and clear batch traceability.</p></div></details>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="olr-faq-group" id="faq-research-use" data-faq-category="research-use">
          <button class="olr-faq-group__heading" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-research-use-questions">
            <span class="olr-faq-group__number">02</span><span>Research use</span><span class="olr-faq-group__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="olr-faq-group__questions" id="faq-research-use-questions" hidden>
            <details><summary>What are Off Label Research products intended for?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>All products are sold for laboratory and research use only. They are not for human consumption.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Can you provide dosing or administration guidance?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>No. We do not provide dosing, administration, or personal-use guidance.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Who may purchase research products?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Purchasers must confirm that products will be used only for lawful laboratory or research purposes.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Do you provide medical advice?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>No. Information on this site is not medical advice and is not a substitute for care from a licensed professional.</p></div></details>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="olr-faq-group" id="faq-ordering" data-faq-category="ordering">
          <button class="olr-faq-group__heading" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-ordering-questions"><span class="olr-faq-group__number">03</span><span>Ordering</span><span class="olr-faq-group__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="olr-faq-group__questions" id="faq-ordering-questions" hidden>
            <details><summary>How do I place an order?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Select an available research product, review its listed strength and documentation, then complete checkout.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Can I change or cancel an order?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Contact support as soon as possible. Changes cannot be guaranteed after fulfillment begins.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Why was my order canceled?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>An order may be canceled when payment cannot be verified, inventory changes, or the order does not meet our research-use requirements.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Where can I review my order?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Sign in to your account to review available order details and status updates.</p></div></details>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="olr-faq-group" id="faq-payment" data-faq-category="payment">
          <button class="olr-faq-group__heading" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-payment-questions"><span class="olr-faq-group__number">04</span><span>Payment</span><span class="olr-faq-group__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="olr-faq-group__questions" id="faq-payment-questions" hidden>
            <details><summary>Which payment methods are accepted?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Current payment methods are shown securely at checkout.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>When will my payment be charged?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Payment is processed when you submit the order, subject to verification by the selected payment provider.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Why did my payment fail?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Confirm your billing details and contact your payment provider if the transaction continues to be declined.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>Will I receive an order receipt?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Yes. A receipt is sent to the email address entered during checkout after the order is accepted.</p></div></details>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="olr-faq-group" id="faq-returns" data-faq-category="returns">
          <button class="olr-faq-group__heading" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-returns-questions"><span class="olr-faq-group__number">05</span><span>Returns + order issues</span><span class="olr-faq-group__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="olr-faq-group__questions" id="faq-returns-questions" hidden>
            <details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Eligibility and timing are described in the current returns policy. Contact support before sending any item back.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>What if I received the wrong item?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Contact support with your order number and clear photos of the shipping label and received item.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>What if an item is missing?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Contact support with your order number and a photo of everything received in the package.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>How long do refunds take?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Approved refunds are submitted promptly, but posting time depends on your payment provider.</p></div></details>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="olr-faq-group" id="faq-account" data-faq-category="account">
          <button class="olr-faq-group__heading" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-account-questions"><span class="olr-faq-group__number">06</span><span>Account + support</span><span class="olr-faq-group__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="olr-faq-group__questions" id="faq-account-questions" hidden>
            <details><summary>How do I access my account?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Open Account to sign in, review orders, and manage the details available to your profile.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>How do I reset my password?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Use the password reset link on the account sign-in page and follow the instructions sent by email.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>How do I contact support?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Email info@offlabelresearch.com with your order number when the question concerns an order.</p></div></details>
            <details><summary>When will support respond?</summary><div class="olr-faq__answer"><p>Support replies as soon as possible during normal business hours. Complex order or carrier issues may require additional review.</p></div></details>
          </div>
        </section>

